lass=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wooden%20Spoon\"><img alt=\"Wooden Spoon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wooden_Spoon_9834aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Wooden%20Spoon\">Wooden Spoon</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Chephan.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: Ah, {looking} for some cooking utensils today, <i>player</i>? Welcome!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>looking</b> / <b>job</b><br/>\nChephan: I {sell} all the cooking utensils you can dream of.\n<i>Player</i>: <b>offer / buy / sell / cooking / ware</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: I offer the best cooking utensils in town. If you like to see my offers, ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>trade</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: Yes, here you are. Choose whatever you need.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nChephan: I'm Chephan, at your service.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: Watches are sold in the south-eastern part of this warehouse.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king or tibianus</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: Even a king needs a fork now and then - to scratch his back or to poke servants for example.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>warehouse</b><br/>\nChephan: Here you can by many things you will need one day or another. Just have a look.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>news</b><br/>\nChephan: My recipes are family secrets, sorry.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>carlin</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: So many women and so little interest in cooking, horrible.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>thais</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: Thaian cooking utensils are of low quality. Make sure to buy our quality wares here as soon as possible.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>excalibug</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: Just an oversized kitchen knife. Better buy a real one.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a></b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: See this fork? Now imagine what a hero like you could do with that fork to an evil sorcerer! Care to buy one?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong>: So long, <i>player</i>.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chephan</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-ice-islands-quest","what-a-foolish-quest"],"pos":{"x":32890,"y":32077,"z":6}}